    },
    {
      "title": "Person × form",
      "table": {
        "headers": ["Person", "Polish", "English"],
        "rows": [
          ["ja", "mam", "I have"],
          ["ty", "masz", "you have (sg)"],
          ["on / ona / ono", "ma", "he / she / it has"],
          ["my", "mamy", "we have"],
          ["wy", "macie", "you have (pl)"],
          ["oni / one", "mają", "they have"]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Objects you need (accusative light)",
      "body": "Feminine -a often → -ę in the object slot. Some words look the same in nom and acc.",
